{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cqgif1.gif?t=1742195967\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Mysterious Ancient Fantasy World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world of ancient Chinese fantasy, brought to life with an ink-painting style and oil-painting textures. Five mysterious regions are home to ferocious beasts and ruthless bandits. Seek out the scattered bamboo scrolls and uncover the secrets hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cqgif2.gif?t=1742195967\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tactical Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 12 unique character classes to build your team and use terrain and skills to defeat your enemies. Battle over 60 fierce creatures and bandits, and challenge more than 10 powerful bosses, each with unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cqbattlegif.gif?t=1742195967\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage a Town and Decipher the Hidden Scrolls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and expand your town with a variety of structures, recruit and train warriors, invest in shops, and perform sacred rituals with the collected scrolls to uncover deeper hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3201830?t=1742195967","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3201830?t=1742195967","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/13fce980e02c10cc4537a156a8a4abb6a08c0592/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742195967","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/13fce980e02c10cc4537a156a8a4abb6a08c0592/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742195967","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cqgif1.gif?t=1742195967\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Mysterious Ancient Fantasy World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world of ancient Chinese fantasy, brought to life with an ink-painting style and oil-painting textures. Five mysterious regions are home to ferocious beasts and ruthless bandits. Seek out the scattered bamboo scrolls and uncover the secrets hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cqgif2.gif?t=1742195967\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tactical Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 12 unique character classes to build your team and use terrain and skills to defeat your enemies. Battle over 60 fierce creatures and bandits, and challenge more than 10 powerful bosses, each with unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201830/extras/cqbattlegif.gif?t=1742195967\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage a Town and Decipher the Hidden Scrolls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and expand your town with a variety of structures, recruit and train warriors, invest in shops, and perform sacred rituals with the collected scrolls to uncover deeper hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["\u7ea2\u9f99\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akam